#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:event.event,description:toy_store.event_event_board_game_nights
msgid ""
"Buy streets and build hotels in <strong>Monopoly</strong>, unmask the "
"murderer in <strong>Cluedo</strong>, line up your words in <strong>Scrabble</"
"strong>, fill your wheel in <strong>Trivial Pursuit</strong> and race your "
"pieces home in <strong>Ludo</strong>. For quicker rounds between two big "
"games, <strong>Connect Four</strong>, <strong>Battleship</strong> and "
"<strong>Snakes and Ladders</strong> are waiting on the side table."
msgstr ""
"ຊື້ຖະໜົນ ແລະ ສ້າງໂຮງແຮມໃນ <strong>Monopoly</strong>, ເປີດໂປງຄາດຕະກອນໃນ <strong>"
"Cluedo</strong>, ຕໍ່ຄຳສັບໃນ <strong>Scrabble</strong>, ຕື່ມວົງລໍ້ຂອງທ່ານໃນ <strong>"
"Trivial Pursuit</strong> ແລະ ພາຕົວເດີນແຂ່ງຂັນກັບເຂົ້າບ້ານໃນ <strong>Ludo</strong>. ສຳ"
"ລັບເກມໄວໆຂັ້ນລະຫວ່າງສອງເກມໃຫຍ່, <strong>Connect Four</strong>, <strong>"
"Battleship</strong> ແລະ <strong>Snakes and Ladders</strong> ພ້ອມລໍຖ້າທ່ານຢູ່ໂຕະຂ້າງ"
"ໆ."

