#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:event.event,description:toy_store.event_event_board_game_nights
msgid ""
"The tables go up and the whole games shelf comes out around 400 boxes, all "
"of them open to play."
msgstr ""
"ໂຕະຕ່າງໆຖືກຈັດຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຊັ້ນເກມທັງໝົດປະມານ 400 ກ່ອງ ພ້ອມເປີດໃຫ້ຫຼິ້ນຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Their daughter Claire took over in the nineties and brought in board games — "
"along with the first demo table, which quickly became the busiest corner of "
"the shop. Her son Tom added the online store in 2019, run from the same back "
"room."
msgstr ""
"ລູກສາວຂອງພວກເຂົາ Claire ໄດ້ເຂົ້າມາສືບທອດກິດຈະການໃນຊຸມປີ 90 ແລະ ໄດ້ນຳເອົາເກມກະດານເຂົ້າມາ — "
"ພ້ອມກັບໂຕະທົດລອງຫຼິ້ນໂຕະທຳອິດ ເຊິ່ງກາຍເປັນມຸມທີ່ຄຶກຄັກທີ່ສຸດຂອງຮ້ານໃນເວລາອັນວ່ອງໄວ. ຕໍ່ມາ Tom ລູກຊາຍຂ"
"ອງນາງ ກໍໄດ້ເປີດຮ້ານຄ້າອອນລາຍໃນປີ 2019 ໂດຍດຳເນີນງານຈາກຫ້ອງຫຼັງຮ້ານດຽວກັນ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Three hundred square feet on Marina Boulevard: wooden toys and an oak "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອທີ່ສາມຮ້ອຍຕາຕະລາງຟຸດເທິງ Marina Boulevard: ເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນໄມ້ ແລະ ເຄົາເຕີໄມ້ໂອ໊ກ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid "Three tables, 24 seats, one themed evening every week open to everyone."
msgstr "ສາມໂຕະ, 24 ບ່ອນນັ່ງ, ຄ່ຳຄືນພິເສດໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ອາທິດທີ່ເປີດຮັບທຸກຄົນ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.website_event_index_oe_structure_we_index_0
msgid ""
"Three tables.<br/>\n"
"                                        Twenty-four seats.<br/>\n"
"                                        One evening a week"
msgstr ""
"ສາມໂຕະ.<br/>\n"
"                                        ຊາວສີ່ບ່ອນນັ່ງ.<br/>\n"
"                                        ໜຶ່ງຄ່ຳຄືນຕໍ່ອາທິດ"

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid "Thursday game nights"
msgstr "ຄ່ຳຄືນຫຼິ້ນເກມວັນພະຫັດ"

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Today the shop covers 600 m² and eleven of us work here. The oak counter "
"never moved, and neither did the rule."
msgstr ""
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນຮ້ານມີເນື້ອທີ່ກວ້າງເຖິງ 600 ຕາຕະລາງແມັດ ແລະ ພວກເຮົາມີພະນັກງານ 11 ຄົນ. ເຄົາເຕີໄມ້ໂອ໊ກຍັງຄົ"
"ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນເກົ່າ ແລະ ກົດເກນກໍຍັງຄົງເດີມບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Tom launches the site and two-hour click &amp;amp; collect, run from the "
"back room."
msgstr ""
"Tom ໄດ້ເປີດໂຕເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ລະບົບສັ່ງຊື້ອອນລາຍແລ້ວມາຮັບເຄື່ອງເອງພາຍໃນ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ (click "
"&amp;amp; collect) ໂດຍດຳເນີນງານຈາກຫ້ອງຫຼັງຮ້ານ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_toy_store
msgid "Toy Store"
msgstr "ຮ້ານຂາຍເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນ"

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:event.event,description:toy_store.event_event_board_game_nights
msgid "Turn up at seven,<br>you are playing by ten past."
msgstr "ມາຮອດຕອນ 19:00,<br>ທ່ານກໍຈະໄດ້ເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນຕອນ 19:10."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We answer during opening hours and can check our stock for you while on the "
"call.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາພ້ອມຕອບສາຍໃນຊ່ວງເວລາເປີດຮ້ານ ແລະ ສາມາດກວດກາສະຕັອກສິນຄ້າໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ທັນທີໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂທລົມກັ"
"ນ.<br/>"

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We select every toy with care: safe materials, honest workmanship and brands "
"we trust. Nothing reaches our shelves by accident."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຄັດສັນທຸກເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນດ້ວຍຄວາມໃສ່ໃຈ: ວັດສະດຸທີ່ປອດໄພ, ຄວາມປານີດຈິງໃຈ ແລະ ແບຣນທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄວ້ວາງ"
"ໃຈ. ບໍ່ມີສິ່ງໃດຂຶ້ນສູ່ຊັ້ນວາງຂອງພວກເຮົາດ້ວຍຄວາມບັງເອີນ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:event.event,description:toy_store.event_event_board_game_nights
msgid ""
"We tidy up together, and whatever you played is on the shelf if you want to "
"take it home."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຊ່ວຍກັນມ້ຽນ, ແລະ ທຸກເກມທີ່ທ່ານຫຼິ້ນກໍມີວາງຂາຍເທິງຊັ້ນວາງ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊື້ກັບບ້ານ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:toy_store.product_template_10
msgid ""
"While a red fox in the wild is typically a solitary creature the red fox "
"plush by Wild Republic is the perfect partner in crime for any stuffed "
"animal lover. At 12 long this plush toy is the perfect size to take on any "
"adventure."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໝາຈອກແດງໃນທຳມະຊາດມັກຈະອາໄສຢູ່ໂຕດຽວ, ແຕ່ຕຸກກະຕາໝາຈອກແດງໂດຍ Wild Republic ເປັ"
"ນຄູ່ຫູທີ່ສົມບູນແບບສຳລັບຄົນຮັກຕຸກກະຕາ. ດ້ວຍຄວາມຍາວ 12 ນິ້ວ, ຕຸກກະຕາຜ້ານີ້ຈຶ່ງມີຂະໜາດພໍດີທີ່ພ້ອມຈະໄປຜະຈົນໄ"
"ພກັບທ່ານໃນທຸກໆບ່ອນ."

#. module: toy_store
#: model:product.template,name:toy_store.product_template_10
msgid "Wild Republic - Red Fox"
msgstr "Wild Republic - ໝາຈອກແດງ (Red Fox)"

#. module: toy_store
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:toy_store.product_attribute_value_42
msgid "Wild republic"
msgstr "Wild republic"

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.website_event_index_oe_structure_we_index_2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.website_event_layout_oe_structure_website_event_layout_1
msgid ""
"Yes, booking is mandatory. It is free and your seat is held until 7:30 pm."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈອງລ່ວງໜ້າ. ການຈອງແມ່ນຟຣີ ແລະ ບ່ອນນັ່ງຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຮອດເວລາ 19:30."

#. module: toy_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.website_event_index_oe_structure_we_index_2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:toy_store.website_event_layout_oe_structure_website_event_layout_1
msgid ""
"Yes. Nothing to pay to sit down and nothing to buy though most people leave "
"with the box they just played."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ນແລ້ວ. ບໍ່ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການນັ່ງຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການບັງຄັບຊື້ໃດໆ ເຖິງວ່າຄົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມັກຈະຊື້ກ່ອງເກມທີ່ຫາກໍ່ຫຼິ້ນຕິດ"
"ມືກັບບ້ານກໍຕາມ."

